WEBVTT

00:13:28.592 --> 00:13:31.265
Passion asks you to throw it
all on the bonfire,

00:13:31.289 --> 00:13:33.615
and curiosity is way more generous,

00:13:33.639 --> 00:13:36.668
in that it just says, "Just give me
a little bit of your time,

00:13:36.692 --> 00:13:38.239
and let's see what we can do."

00:13:38.263 --> 00:13:42.680
CA: Another of the pillars
of creativity in your worldview,

00:13:42.704 --> 00:13:44.380
I think, is courage.

00:13:44.404 --> 00:13:46.850
Can you talk about courage?
Why does courage matter?

00:13:46.874 --> 00:13:50.254
EG: Well, courage matters, especially
in the importance of defining it,

00:13:50.278 --> 00:13:53.187
as opposed to fearlessness,
which is what our culture honors,

00:13:53.211 --> 00:13:54.772
and which is also brutal.

00:13:54.796 --> 00:13:56.818
You know, we live in
a very brutal culture.

00:13:56.842 --> 00:13:59.175
There's a lot of demands put on people

00:13:59.199 --> 00:14:01.732
in terms of what they are expected to be,